<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-lustro</span></b> , āvi, ātum,
		1, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To go</i> or <i>wander all
			through</i>, <i>to traverse completely.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hostium agros,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 8,
					36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">haec omnia (loca),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
					34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perlustrata armis tota Germania,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell. 2, 106, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to view all
			over</i>, <i>to examine</i>, <i>survey</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hujus materiae perlustrandae animo partes erunt
					omnes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Part. 11, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnia oculis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					25, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">diu perlustrans oculis hostium turres,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					23, 46, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perlustra mea dicta,</span>”
				<i>examine</i>, <i>consult</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 4, 3, 143</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To purify</i> or <i>hallow
			completely</i> with religious acts: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sulphure et bitumine aliquid perlustrare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 5, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
